+## 11.2.1
+
+### Patch Changes
+
+- adc91b9: Prevent V6 Core SDK timeout retries from evaluating two in-flight script responses. Explicit script errors still retry, while slow requests now wait up to 30 seconds on the original script instead of inserting another one.
